  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tonga Health Workforce Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity will establish a new health programme in Tonga with the goal of supporting and developing Tonga&#x2019;s Health Workforce to deliver quality health services and improve health outcomes for Tongan communities.
The programme&#xa0;aims to support and strengthen at a&#xa0;systems level, rather than focusing on a specific sub-sector, to reflect&#xa0;the priorities of the Tongan Ministry of Health.</narrative>
  </description>
